  "long_description": "Versine lets your agents send and receive money. We’re Venmo for agents.\r\n\r\nConnect it to ChatGPT, Claude, Muse or your own agent through our MCP. Then send your agent a dinner receipt and it splits the bill. Tell it “if I don’t run 10k tomorrow, pay Jake $10” and it checks Strava and pays out if you miss. It can also pay invoices that land in your inbox, or split rent and utilities with your roommates every month. \r\n\r\nRecipients don’t need an account: they get a link to cash out to their bank.\r\n\r\nBanking and payout services are provided by licensed partners.",
